---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import { skillGroups } from '../data/skills';
---

<section id="skills" class="border-y border-border scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="container-page py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:items-end">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="eyebrow">The toolkit</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">
          Tools I reach for when the problem calls for them.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-muted lg:justify-self-end lg:text-lg">
        The stack changes with the work. These are the tools I have used to shape interfaces, APIs, CMS workflows, and experiments.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 border-y border-border sm:mt-12" data-reveal>
      {
        skillGroups.map((group, index) => (
          <article class:list={['grid gap-5 py-7 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8 md:py-8', index > 0 && 'border-t border-border']}>
            <div>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-muted">0{index + 1}</p>
              <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-fg">{group.title}</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap content-start gap-x-5 gap-y-3" aria-label={group.title}>
              {group.items.map((skill) => (
                <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg">
                  {skill.icon && <Icon name={skill.icon} width={16} height={16} class="text-muted" aria-hidden="true" />}
                  {skill.name}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
      Right now, I am learning more about AI agents, system design, and ways to make everyday engineering work less repetitive.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
